   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A result or change of situation",
     "texto": [
      "**-게 되다** presents an action as the result of a process, circumstances or a new arrangement: 살다 → **살게 됐어요** (I ended up living), 일하다 → **일하게 됐어요** (I started / ended up working), 가다 → **가게 됐어요** (it turned out that I went). It does not necessarily mean that someone forced you or that it was against your will.",
      "서울 병원에서 **일하게 됐어요** = I ended up working at a hospital in Seoul."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With negation",
     "texto": [
      "With **못** you say that it was not possible: 못 가다 → **못 가게 됐어요** (I ended up unable to go).",
      "It is the opposite of **-게 했어요** (I made it so that…), which is a different topic."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
